  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::UIAnimLab.Station
  Code: A2
  Title: A player's own animation wins
  Summary: This player uses Button Set, but has its own Press as well.
  Watch: Special's Animations
  WatchObjects:
  - {fileID: 1258648216}
  HowTo: Select Special's Animations. Read the grey notes on both Press entries,
    and the note above the Play buttons. Play Press.
  Expect: The player's own Press reads 'overrides shared'; the set's, under Shared
    Animations, reads 'overridden locally'. Playing Press shakes the star and grows
    the button (the local one), not the set's tint.
  Needs: 5
  Style: 0
  WikiPage: 
