  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 3269ab77e5738674b9fefab358f453ff, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::UIAnimLab.Station
  Code: A3
  Title: Each player's own On Complete, and Override
  Summary: Two panels share Panel Set's Show. Each player has its own On Complete
    for it, switching on its own tick.
  Watch: each panel's Animations
  WatchObjects:
  - {fileID: 1717269128}
  - {fileID: 1305589105}
  HowTo: 'In play mode click Show L, then Show R. Out of play mode: open Show under
    Panel L''s Shared Animations, rename Show to Appear in Panel Set.asset, and check
    the On Complete is still attached. Then press Override on it. Undo both afterwards.'
  Expect: Each Show ticks only its own panel. After the rename the entry stays attached.
    After Override, Show appears in the player's own list with the On Complete moved
    onto it.
  Needs: 6
  Style: 0
  WikiPage: 
  Capture: 
