  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::UIAnimLab.Station
  Code: G3
  Title: A path that matches nothing
  Summary: 'Step 0 aims at Panel/Iconn - a typo. It must do nothing: never spin some
    other object instead.'
  Watch: Panel, Icon
  WatchObjects:
  - {fileID: 1376090098}
  - {fileID: 470972865}
  HowTo: Look at Spin's steps. Preview Spin. Enter play mode, click Spin twice, and
    check the Console.
  Expect: Step 0's header ends in a warning sign, its fields below the target are
    greyed, and a warning says Target Path "Stage/Panel/Iconn" matches nothing. Playing
    only punches the panel; nothing spins. The Console gets ONE warning about it,
    at start-up, however often Spin is played.
  Needs: 23
