  m_text: '<b>Expect:</b> The set''s Pop has paths ''..'' (card) and ''../Icon'',
    and ''../../Elsewhere'' for the heart (up to the stage, then down). The second
    Twin can''t be reached by name: the Console lists it, and that step warns. Notify''s
    On Complete was left out, since it pointed at a scene object. The player itself
    is unchanged.'
